<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to May 2.</p>
<p>    Top 10 gains in month</p>
<p>				 Price   percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		     May 2   change</p>
<p> 1   Sthn Pac Pete	  3.84    25.49</p>
<p> 2   Westfield Hlds	24.10    20.62</p>
<p> 3   CSL Limited	    7.15    18.38</p>
<p> 4   Burswood Prop Tr     1.53    17.69</p>
<p> 5   Wesfarmers	    10.91    17.04</p>
<p> 6   Brambles Inds	 23.35    16.46</p>
<p> 7   Amalgamated Hlds     7.00    13.82</p>
